<title>INDIA: India Reliance AGM adjournes for bonus.</title>
<headline>India Reliance AGM adjournes for bonus.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Reliance Industries Ltd briefly adjourned its annual general meeting to hold a board meeting to consider a bonus issue of shares, officials said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
